### Update Product (Admin Only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 166.00,
  "stock": 9
}

### Get Low Stock Products (Admin Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/inventory/low-stock?threshold=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Out of Stock Products (Admin Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/inventory/out-of-stock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete Product (Admin Only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get All Orders (User sees own, Admin sees all)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Single Order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Order Status (Admin Only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "processing"
}

